<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Learning the Context of Errors: Black-Box Online Adaptation of Time Series Foundation Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Xilin Dai
